  "description": "Expand your gravel adventures with the Confluence GRX600 2x. This gravel ebike features a lightweight MAHLE hub-drive system that puts down 40Nm of torque in a stealthy package. The aluminum frame and carbon fork balance weight, comfort, and performance. Confluence’s geometry is designed for a comfortable, stable ride, even at higher average speeds than you’re used to on bumpy backroads. Confluence also comes with our on-bike cargo features, allowing for quick and easy configuration for adventures ranging from gravel day-rides to last-minute bikepacking trips. All this, paired with Shimano’s GRX600 2x drivetrain, means you’ll have the tools to pull off more rides than ever. Charge Your Adventure with Confluence GRX600 2x.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
